# Bus Ticket Booking Portal

A web-based bus ticket booking platform built as a lab final project. The application simulates a complete booking experience — from selecting routes and seats to passenger verification, payment simulation, and booking confirmation.

## Live Demo

Try the project here:

[Launch Bus Ticket Portal]https://bus-compass.preview.emergentagent.com

---

## Features

### Ticket Search
- Select departure and destination cities
- Choose travel date
- Search available buses based on route

### Bus Selection
- Browse multiple bus options
- View timings, pricing, seat availability, and travel duration

### Seat Booking
- Interactive seat selection interface
- Real-time seat availability simulation
- Booking summary with total fare calculation

### Passenger Information
- Passenger detail form
- Booking summary sidebar
- Multi-step booking workflow

### Verification & Payment
- Human verification step
- OTP-based booking simulation
- Payment confirmation workflow

### Final Confirmation
- Ticket confirmation page
- Booking summary with generated ticket details

