## Project Purpose

This project was built as a lab final submission to explore practical web application workflows through a real-world use case.

The project helped me understand:
- Multi-step user workflows
- Form handling and validation
- UI/UX design for booking systems
- State handling across booking stages
- User interaction and flow design

---

## Tech Stack

- Web-based Frontend
- Interactive UI Components
- Booking Workflow Logic
- Built using Emergent

---

## Notes

This is a student project created for learning and demonstration purposes. Payment, OTP, and booking systems are simulated for educational use.
